https://www.coindesk.com/markets\"><![CDATA[Markets]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"tag\"><![CDATA[Hyperliquid]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"tag\"><![CDATA[XRP News]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"tag\"><![CDATA[Markets]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"tag\"><![CDATA[Bitcoin News]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"tag\"><![CDATA[Ethereum News]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/\">News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title><![CDATA[Hyperliquid is emerging as a challenger to traditional exchanges and prediction markets, says FalconX]]></title>\n      <link>https://www.coindesk.com/markets/2026/05/25/hyperliquid-is-emerging-as-a-challenger-to-traditional-exchanges-and-prediction-markets-says-falconx</link>\n      <media:content url=\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/s3y3vcno/production/7abb923cd3f5036c351144b00a69fb04fe321e58-6000x4000.jpg?fm=jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;h=1080&amp;crop=focalpoint&amp;fit=clip\" type=\"image/*\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">43d82d50-9040-437e-b817-2324f5d00b6f</guid>\n      <pubDate>Mon, 25 May 2026 08:09:00 +0000</pubDate>\n      <description><![CDATA[A new report shows Hyperliquid is rapidly expanding beyond crypto into pre-IPO markets, prediction contracts, and 24/7 asset trading, putting Wall Street giants on high alert.]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Helene Braun</dc:creator>\n      <dc:creator>AI Boost</dc:creator>\n      <content:encoded/>\n      <dc:description/>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/markets\"><![CDATA[Markets]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"tag\"><![CDATA[Hyperliquid]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/\">News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title><![CDATA[Bitcoin trades above $77,000 as oil's 5% slide pushes Asian equities higher]]></title>\n      <link>https://www.coindesk.com/markets/2026/05/25/bitcoin-trades-above-usd77-000-as-oil-s-5-slide-pushes-asian-equities-higher</link>\n      <media:content url=\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/s3y3vcno/production/3df6f4ba6e8319031d4b0cfeff769be256ca23f1-2846x1076.png?fm=jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;h=1080&amp;crop=focalpoint&amp;fit=clip\" type=\"image/*\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">8f362105-68f0-4833-99d8-a9540daa6f9b</guid>\n      <pubDate>Mon, 25 May 2026 07:11:57 +0000</pubDate>\n      <description><![CDATA[Oil’s 5% drop on potential Strait of Hormuz reopening boosted Asian equities and supported crypto sentiment.]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Omkar Godbole</dc:creator>\n      <content:encoded/>\n      <dc:description/>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/markets\"><![CDATA[Markets]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"tag\"><![CDATA[Bitcoin News]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/\">News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title><![CDATA[Bitcoin options are coming to Nasdaq. Here's what it means for you. ]]></title>\n      <link>https://www.coindesk.com/markets/2026/05/25/bitcoin-options-are-coming-to-nadaq-here-s-what-it-means-for-you</link>\n      <media:content url=\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/s3y3vcno/production/04f231dbc1b627628eb7b1afe3073540e1eb17e2-1690x751.png?fm=jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;h=1080&amp;crop=focalpoint&amp;fit=clip\" type=\"image/*\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">c1d9d0d8-4569-4e24-b0cb-cfe1662532bd</guid>\n      <pubDate>Mon, 25 May 2026 05:56:43 +0000</pubDate>\n      <description><![CDATA[The new offering, pending CFTC approval, aims to democratize seamless crypto risk management ]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Omkar Godbole</dc:creator>\n      <content:encoded/>\n      <dc:description/>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/markets\"><![CDATA[Markets]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"tag\"><![CDATA[Nasdaq]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"tag\"><![CDATA[Bitcoin News]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/\">News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title><![CDATA[Coinbase does not fear competition from Wall Street, says exchange executive ]]></title>\n      <link>https://www.coindesk.com/business/2026/05/24/coinbase-does-not-fear-competition-from-wall-street-says-exchange-executive</link>\n      <media:content url=\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/s3y3vcno/production/28e20aa39755d08704ebad7ea0152308c4970d4f-1280x960.jpg?fm=jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;h=1080&amp;crop=focalpoint&amp;fit=clip\" type=\"image/*\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">033e16b2-e174-4a99-abbc-469e917d607c</guid>\n      <pubDate>Sun, 24 May 2026 20:00:00 +0000</pubDate>\n      <description><![CDATA[A Coinbase executive called on regulators to implement sensible crypto regulation, while announcing the Stand With Crypto event taking place in over 500 locations worldwide.]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Olivier Acuna</dc:creator>\n      <content:encoded/>\n      <dc:description/>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/business\"><![CDATA[Finance]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"tag\"><![CDATA[Coinbase]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"tag\"><![CDATA[Bitcoin News]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"tag\"><![CDATA[Institutional Adoption]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/\">News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title><![CDATA[Crypto and the Fed: State of Crypto ]]></title>\n      <link>https://www.coindesk.com/policy/2026/05/24/crypto-and-the-fed-state-of-crypto</link>\n      <media:content url=\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/s3y3vcno/production/abfc53cb8936b0ca235301bd25a7729a38804863-4928x3264.jpg?fm=jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;h=1080&amp;crop=focalpoint&amp;fit=clip\" type=\"image/*\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">2bf94496-3e09-4f5d-b44a-2196b9810b24</guid>\n      <pubDate>Sun, 24 May 2026 18:30:00 +0000</pubDate>\n      <description><![CDATA[This past week saw incremental, but potentially important steps.]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Nikhilesh De</dc:creator>\n      <content:encoded/>\n      <dc:description/>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/policy\"><![CDATA[Policy]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"tag\"><![CDATA[Newsletters]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"tag\"><![CDATA[State of Crypto]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/\">News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title><![CDATA[A massive $1 trillion hidden market is waiting to be unlocked in bitcoin, says new report]]></title>\n      <link>https://www.coindesk.com/business/2026/05/22/ledn</link>\n      <media:content url=\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/s3y3vcno/production/b5d61433a7938f2a44279c76d6a4b0aa0600e1eb-1920x1227.jpg?fm=jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;h=1080&amp;crop=focalpoint&amp;fit=clip\" type=\"image/*\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">56c4e30c-78de-4682-8b13-a6a8102bd8fb</guid>\n      <pubDate>Sun, 24 May 2026 15:00:00 +0000</pubDate>\n      <description><![CDATA[Ledn forecasts the bitcoin-backed lending market could grow to $1 trillion within a decade as new research highlights strong borrower demand.]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Jamie Crawley</dc:creator>\n      <dc:creator>AI Boost</dc:creator>\n      <content:encoded/>\n      <dc:description/>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/business\"><![CDATA[Finance]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"tag\"><![CDATA[Crypto News]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/\">News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title><![CDATA[AI is speeding up the quantum threat to crypto, security experts warn]]></title>\n      <link>https://www.coindesk.com/tech/2026/05/24/ai-is-speeding-up-the-quantum-threat-to-crypto-security-experts-warn</link>\n      <media:content url=\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/s3y3vcno/production/8caf5bf2426a0c13deda3f4b9b88b574b91c1a55-5493x3662.jpg?fm=jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;h=1080&amp;crop=focalpoint&amp;fit=clip\" type=\"image/*\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">defd7385-59d8-4181-ac5c-e2738309343b</guid>\n      <pubDate>Sun, 24 May 2026 14:00:00 +0000</pubDate>\n      <description><![CDATA[Researchers and builders believe that artificial intelligence may be accelerating the quantum timeline and forcing a broader rethink of how digital security works.]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Margaux Nijkerk</dc:creator>\n      <content:encoded/>\n      <dc:description/>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/tech\"><![CDATA[Tech]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"tag\"><![CDATA[Artificial Intelligence]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"tag\"><![CDATA[quantum computing]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"tag\"><![CDATA[Solana News]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"tag\"><![CDATA[Ethereum News]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"tag\"><![CDATA[Bitcoin News]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/\">News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title><![CDATA[Crypto rails are becoming the default payment layer for AI agents, report says]]></title>\n      <link>https://www.coindesk.com/business/2026/05/21/crypto-rails-are-becoming-the-default-payment-layer-for-ai-agents-report-says</link>\n      <media:content url=\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/s3y3vcno/production/c4b55ff67ef1d065e3e2e556ba0209a416b27d44-2048x1365.jpg?fm=jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;h=1080&amp;crop=focalpoint&amp;fit=clip\" type=\"image/*\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">395d1b11-418b-49d2-9c59-dcf9d47fad5a</guid>\n      <pubDate>Sun, 24 May 2026 13:00:00 +0000</pubDate>\n      <description><![CDATA[A new report from Keyrock says stablecoins on blockchain rails are becoming the go-to payment layer for AI agents as traditional card rails struggle to handle micropayments.]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Krisztian Sandor</dc:creator>\n      <content:encoded/>\n      <dc:description/>\n 