{"type":"message","id":"6235adfd","parentId":"e96cbccd","timestamp":"2026-05-25T11:21:24.876Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"exec","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"utf-8\"?>\n<rss version=\"2.0\" xmlns:content=\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/\" xmlns:media=\"http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/\" xmlns:dc=\"http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/\" xmlns:wfw=\"http://wellformedweb.org/CommentAPI/\" xmlns:atom=\"http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom\" xmlns:sy=\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/syndication/\" xmlns:slash=\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/slash/\">\n  <channel>\n    <title>Cointelegraph.com News</title>\n    <link>https://cointelegraph.com</link>\n    <atom:link href=\"https://cointelegraph.com/rss?_dc=1779707287048&amp;cachebust=true&amp;cb=scbhjz\" rel=\"self\" type=\"application/rss+xml\"/>\n    <description>Cointelegraph covers fintech, blockchain and Bitcoin bringing you the latest crypto news and analyses on the future of money.</description>\n    <generator>cointelegraph.com</generator>\n    <lastBuildDate>Mon, 25 May 2026 11:08:08 +0000</lastBuildDate>\n    <language>en</language>\n    <sy:updatePeriod>hourly</sy:updatePeriod>\n    <sy:updateFrequency>1</sy:updateFrequency>\n    <image>\n      <title>Cointelegraph.com News</title>\n      <link>https://cointelegraph.com</link>\n      <url>https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/b9ea15d46738b4df64e6e100ab59b373.png</url>\n      <description>Cointelegraph covers fintech, blockchain and Bitcoin bringing you the latest crypto news and analyses on the future of money.</description>\n    </image>\n    <item>\n      <title>Crypto entrepreneur Chun Wang joins SpaceX mission to Mars</title>\n      <pubDate>Mon, 25 May 2026 07:15:39 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Mon, 25 May 2026 07:15:39 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/chun-wang-spacex-mars-mission-crypto-entrepreneur</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/chun-wang-spacex-mars-mission-crypto-entrepreneur?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1waWxvdC1sYXVuY2gtd2hhdC1pdC1tZWFucy1mb3ItcGlvbmVlcnMuanBn.jpg\" alt=\"Crypto entrepreneur Chun Wang joins SpaceX mission to Mars\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>Chun Wang, who bankrolled and led a SpaceX flight over Earth’s poles, says he will head to Mars on SpaceX’s first manned mission to the red planet.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Stephen Katte</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1waWxvdC1sYXVuY2gtd2hhdC1pdC1tZWFucy1mb3ItcGlvbmVlcnMuanBn.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1waWxvdC1sYXVuY2gtd2hhdC1pdC1tZWFucy1mb3ItcGlvbmVlcnMuanBn.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>Bitcoin ETFs' 6 day loss streak pushes market closer to net outflows for 2026</title>\n      <pubDate>Mon, 25 May 2026 06:58:35 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Mon, 25 May 2026 06:58:35 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-etf-outflow-streak-pushes-market-closer-to-net-negative-flows-for-2026</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-etf-outflow-streak-pushes-market-closer-to-net-negative-flows-for-2026?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS12YW5lY2std2FybnMtd2h5LWJpdGNvaW4tdHJlYXN1cnktY29tcGFuaWVzLWNvdWxkLWZhY2UtY2FwaXRhbC1lcm9zaW9uLWV0Zi0xLmpwZw==.jpg\" alt=\"Bitcoin ETFs' 6 day loss streak pushes market closer to net outflows for 2026\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>Dek: US Bitcoin ETF net inflows have shrunk to $536 million so far in 2026, after recording a six-day run of net outflows totalling $1.55 billion.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Brayden Lindrea</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS12YW5lY2std2FybnMtd2h5LWJpdGNvaW4tdHJlYXN1cnktY29tcGFuaWVzLWNvdWxkLWZhY2UtY2FwaXRhbC1lcm9zaW9uLWV0Zi0xLmpwZw==.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS12YW5lY2std2FybnMtd2h5LWJpdGNvaW4tdHJlYXN1cnktY29tcGFuaWVzLWNvdWxkLWZhY2UtY2FwaXRhbC1lcm9zaW9uLWV0Zi0xLmpwZw==.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>‘TrapDoor’ malware targets crypto dev tools in supply chain attack</title>\n      <pubDate>Mon, 25 May 2026 06:25:28 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Mon, 25 May 2026 06:25:28 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/coordinated-crypto-stealer-campaign-trapdoor-detected-targeting-developers</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/coordinated-crypto-stealer-campaign-trapdoor-detected-targeting-developers?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1ob3ctc2NhbW1lcnMtZXhwbG9pdC10cnVzdGVkLXBsYXRmb3Jtcy1mb3ItY3J5cHRvLWZyYXVkLmpwZw==.jpg\" alt=\"‘TrapDoor’ malware targets crypto dev tools in supply chain attack\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>Socket says a campaign of malicious packages is aiming to steal crypto and is injecting hidden instructions that hijack popular AI coding assistants.  </p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Martin Young</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1ob3ctc2NhbW1lcnMtZXhwbG9pdC10cnVzdGVkLXBsYXRmb3Jtcy1mb3ItY3J5cHRvLWZyYXVkLmpwZw==.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1ob3ctc2NhbW1lcnMtZXhwbG9pdC10cnVzdGVkLXBsYXRmb3Jtcy1mb3ItY3J5cHRvLWZyYXVkLmpwZw==.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title> ‘Developed ecosystem’ based on crypto has sprung up for AI agents: Report</title>\n      <pubDate>Mon, 25 May 2026 05:41:44 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Mon, 25 May 2026 05:41:44 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/ai-agents-using-stablecoins-as-default-settlement-layer-keyrock</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/ai-agents-using-stablecoins-as-default-settlement-layer-keyrock?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS10aGUtbWFya2V0LXR1cm5zLWl0cy1hdHRlbnRpb24tdG8tc3RhYmxlY29pbi1yZWd1bGF0aW9uLTEuanBn.jpg\" alt=\" ‘Developed ecosystem’ based on crypto has sprung up for AI agents: Report\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>Stablecoins became the default settlement layer for AI agents as crypto payment rails can handle sub-dollar transactions more efficiently, says a report from Keyrock.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Stephen Katte</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS10aGUtbWFya2V0LXR1cm5zLWl0cy1hdHRlbnRpb24tdG8tc3RhYmxlY29pbi1yZWd1bGF0aW9uLTEuanBn.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS10aGUtbWFya2V0LXR1cm5zLWl0cy1hdHRlbnRpb24tdG8tc3RhYmxlY29pbi1yZWd1bGF0aW9uLTEuanBn.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>Kalshi backs prediction markets lobby group with former Trump official</title>\n      <pubDate>Mon, 25 May 2026 05:07:32 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Mon, 25 May 2026 05:07:32 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/kalshi-launches-advocacy-group-to-counter-anti-prediction-market-lobbying</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/kalshi-launches-advocacy-group-to-counter-anti-prediction-market-lobbying?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1sZWdhbC1pbXBsaWNhdGlvbnMtb2YtYmV0dGluZy1tYXJrZXRzLmpwZw==.jpg\" alt=\"Kalshi backs prediction markets lobby group with former Trump official\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>\"We’re not going to be outspent or out-organized by entrenched interests protecting their monopolies,\" said John Bivona, head of government relations at Kalshi.\n</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Martin Young</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1sZWdhbC1pbXBsaWNhdGlvbnMtb2YtYmV0dGluZy1tYXJrZXRzLmpwZw==.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1sZWdhbC1pbXBsaWNhdGlvbnMtb2YtYmV0dGluZy1tYXJrZXRzLmpwZw==.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>SEC postpones plan allowing 'innovation exemption' for tokenized stocks: Report</title>\n      <pubDate>Mon, 25 May 2026 03:45:13 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Mon, 25 May 2026 03:45:13 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/sec-postpones-plan-allowing-innovation-exemption-for-tokenized-stocks-report</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/sec-postpones-plan-allowing-innovation-exemption-for-tokenized-stocks-report?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS13aHktcmVndWxhdGlvbi1pcy10aGUtYmVzdC10aGluZy1mb3ItY3J5cHRvLXNlYy5qcGc=.jpg\" alt=\"SEC postpones plan allowing 'innovation exemption' for tokenized stocks: Report\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>The SEC has reportedly delayed releasing a proposal permitting tokenized stock trading after receiving industry concerns.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Brayden Lindrea</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS13aHktcmVndWxhdGlvbi1pcy10aGUtYmVzdC10aGluZy1mb3ItY3J5cHRvLXNlYy5qcGc=.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS13aHktcmVndWxhdGlvbi1pcy10aGUtYmVzdC10aGluZy1mb3ItY3J5cHRvLXNlYy5qcGc=.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>Soaring bond prices signal 'structural' shift and Bitcoin 'supercycle': Analyst</title>\n      <pubDate>Sun, 24 May 2026 22:12:55 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Sun, 24 May 2026 22:12:55 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/soaring-bond-prices-structural-shift-bitcoin-supercycle</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/soaring-bond-prices-structural-shift-bitcoin-supercycle?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9zcG9uc29yLXNjcmVlbi10cmFpZDIzLmpwZw==.jpg\" alt=\"Soaring bond prices signal 'structural' shift and Bitcoin 'supercycle': Analyst\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>Fixed-income investors are in a \"panic\" as government securities, once seen as low-risk, begin to crack, according to BitMEX researcher Shang Wu.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Vince Quill</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9zcG9uc29yLXNjcmVlbi10cmFpZDIzLmpwZw==.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9zcG9uc29yLXNjcmVlbi10cmFpZDIzLmpwZw==.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>Buterin fires back at Ethereum Foundation critics, recommits to neutrality</title>\n      <pubDate>Sun, 24 May 2026 20:43:42 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Sun, 24 May 2026 20:43:42 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/buterin-fires-back-ef-critics-neutrality</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/buterin-fires-back-ef-critics-neutrality?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy92aXRhbGlrLXBvcnRyYWl0LTAwMi5qcGc=.jpg\" alt=\"Buterin fires back at Ethereum Foundation critics, recommits to neutrality\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>The Ethereum Foundation holds less than 1% of all ETH in circulation while other protocol foundations typically hold 10-50% of their native token's supply, the founder said.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Vince Quill</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy92aXRhbGlrLXBvcnRyYWl0LTAwMi5qcGc=.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy92aXRhbGlrLXBvcnRyYWl0LTAwMi5qcGc=.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title><![CDATA[FTX law firm Fenwick & West to pay $54M to victims in settlement]]></title>\n      <pubDate>Sun, 24 May 2026 18:05:52 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Sun, 24 May 2026 18:05:52 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/law-firm-fenwick-west-54m-ftx-settlement</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/law-firm-fenwick-west-54m-ftx-settlement?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>[... 36819 more characters truncated]"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":409,"aggregated":"<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"utf-8\"?>\n<rss version=\"2.0\" xmlns:content=\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/\" xmlns:media=\"http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/\" xmlns:dc=\"http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/\" xmlns:wfw=\"http://wellformedweb.org/CommentAPI/\" xmlns:atom=\"http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom\" xmlns:sy=\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/syndication/\" xmlns:slash=\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/slash/\">\n  <channel>\n    <title>Cointelegraph.com News</title>\n    <link>https://cointelegraph.com</link>\n    <atom:link href=\"https://cointelegraph.com/rss?_dc=1779707287048&amp;cachebust=true&amp;cb=scbhjz\" rel=\"self\" type=\"application/rss+xml\"/>\n    <description>Cointelegraph covers fintech, blockchain and Bitcoin bringing you the latest crypto news and analyses on the future of money.</description>\n    <generator>cointelegraph.com</generator>\n    <lastBuildDate>Mon, 25 May 2026 11:08:08 +0000</lastBuildDate>\n    <language>en</language>\n    <sy:updatePeriod>hourly</sy:updatePeriod>\n    <sy:updateFrequency>1</sy:updateFrequency>\n    <image>\n      <title>Cointelegraph.com News</title>\n      <link>https://cointelegraph.com</link>\n      <url>https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/b9ea15d46738b4df64e6e100ab59b373.png</url>\n      <description>Cointelegraph covers fintech, blockchain and Bitcoin bringing you the latest crypto news and analyses on the future of money.</description>\n    </image>\n    <item>\n      <title>Crypto entrepreneur Chun Wang joins SpaceX mission to Mars</title>\n      <pubDate>Mon, 25 May 2026 07:15:39 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Mon, 25 May 2026 07:15:39 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/chun-wang-spacex-mars-mission-crypto-entrepreneur</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/chun-wang-spacex-mars-mission-crypto-entrepreneur?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1waWxvdC1sYXVuY2gtd2hhdC1pdC1tZWFucy1mb3ItcGlvbmVlcnMuanBn.jpg\" alt=\"Crypto entrepreneur Chun Wang joins SpaceX mission to Mars\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>Chun Wang, who bankrolled and led a SpaceX flight over Earth’s poles, says he will head to Mars on SpaceX’s first manned mission to the red planet.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Stephen Katte</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1waWxvdC1sYXVuY2gtd2hhdC1pdC1tZWFucy1mb3ItcGlvbmVlcnMuanBn.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1waWxvdC1sYXVuY2gtd2hhdC1pdC1tZWFucy1mb3ItcGlvbmVlcnMuanBn.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>Bitcoin ETFs' 6 day loss streak pushes market closer to net outflows for 2026</title>\n      <pubDate>Mon, 25 May 2026 06:58:35 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Mon, 25 May 2026 06:58:35 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-etf-outflow-streak-pushes-market-closer-to-net-negative-flows-for-2026</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-etf-outflow-streak-pushes-market-closer-to-net-negative-flows-for-2026?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS12YW5lY2std2FybnMtd2h5LWJpdGNvaW4tdHJlYXN1cnktY29tcGFuaWVzLWNvdWxkLWZhY2UtY2FwaXRhbC1lcm9zaW9uLWV0Zi0xLmpwZw==.jpg\" alt=\"Bitcoin ETFs' 6 day loss streak pushes market closer to net outflows for 2026\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>Dek: US Bitcoin ETF net inflows have shrunk to $536 million so far in 2026, after recording a six-day run of net outflows totalling $1.55 billion.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Brayden Lindrea</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS12YW5lY2std2FybnMtd2h5LWJpdGNvaW4tdHJlYXN1cnktY29tcGFuaWVzLWNvdWxkLWZhY2UtY2FwaXRhbC1lcm9zaW9uLWV0Zi0xLmpwZw==.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS12YW5lY2std2FybnMtd2h5LWJpdGNvaW4tdHJlYXN1cnktY29tcGFuaWVzLWNvdWxkLWZhY2UtY2FwaXRhbC1lcm9zaW9uLWV0Zi0xLmpwZw==.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>‘TrapDoor’ malware targets crypto dev tools in supply chain attack</title>\n      <pubDate>Mon, 25 May 2026 06:25:28 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Mon, 25 May 2026 06:25:28 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/coordinated-crypto-stealer-campaign-trapdoor-detected-targeting-developers</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/coordinated-crypto-stealer-campaign-trapdoor-detected-targeting-developers?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1ob3ctc2NhbW1lcnMtZXhwbG9pdC10cnVzdGVkLXBsYXRmb3Jtcy1mb3ItY3J5cHRvLWZyYXVkLmpwZw==.jpg\" alt=\"‘TrapDoor’ malware targets crypto dev tools in supply chain attack\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>Socket says a campaign of malicious packages is aiming to steal crypto and is injecting hidden instructions that hijack popular AI coding assistants.  </p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Martin Young</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1ob3ctc2NhbW1lcnMtZXhwbG9pdC10cnVzdGVkLXBsYXRmb3Jtcy1mb3ItY3J5cHRvLWZyYXVkLmpwZw==.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1ob3ctc2NhbW1lcnMtZXhwbG9pdC10cnVzdGVkLXBsYXRmb3Jtcy1mb3ItY3J5cHRvLWZyYXVkLmpwZw==.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title> ‘Developed ecosystem’ based on crypto has sprung up for AI agents: Report</title>\n      <pubDate>Mon, 25 May 2026 05:41:44 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Mon, 25 May 2026 05:41:44 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/ai-agents-using-stablecoins-as-default-settlement-layer-keyrock</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/ai-agents-using-stablecoins-as-default-settlement-layer-keyrock?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS10aGUtbWFya2V0LXR1cm5zLWl0cy1hdHRlbnRpb24tdG8tc3RhYmxlY29pbi1yZWd1bGF0aW9uLTEuanBn.jpg\" alt=\" ‘Developed ecosystem’ based on crypto has sprung up for AI agents: Report\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>Stablecoins became the default settlement layer for AI agents as crypto payment rails can handle sub-dollar transactions more efficiently, says a report from Keyrock.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Stephen Katte</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS10aGUtbWFya2V0LXR1cm5zLWl0cy1hdHRlbnRpb24tdG8tc3RhYmxlY29pbi1yZWd1bGF0aW9uLTEuanBn.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS10aGUtbWFya2V0LXR1cm5zLWl0cy1hdHRlbnRpb24tdG8tc3RhYmxlY29pbi1yZWd1bGF0aW9uLTEuanBn.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>Kalshi backs prediction markets lobby group with former Trump official</title>\n      <pubDate>Mon, 25 May 2026 05:07:32 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Mon, 25 May 2026 05:07:32 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/kalshi-launches-advocacy-group-to-counter-anti-prediction-market-lobbying</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/kalshi-launches-advocacy-group-to-counter-anti-prediction-market-lobbying?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1sZWdhbC1pbXBsaWNhdGlvbnMtb2YtYmV0dGluZy1tYXJrZXRzLmpwZw==.jpg\" alt=\"Kalshi backs prediction markets lobby group with former Trump official\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>\"We’re not going to be outspent or out-organized by entrenched interests protecting their monopolies,\" said John Bivona, head of government relations at Kalshi.\n</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Martin Young</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1sZWdhbC1pbXBsaWNhdGlvbnMtb2YtYmV0dGluZy1tYXJrZXRzLmpwZw==.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1sZWdhbC1pbXBsaWNhdGlvbnMtb2YtYmV0dGluZy1tYXJrZXRzLmpwZw==.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>SEC postpones plan allowing 'innovation exemption' for tokenized stocks: Report</title>\n      <pubDate>Mon, 25 May 2026 03:45:13 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Mon, 25 May 2026 03:45:13 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/sec-postpones-plan-allowing-innovation-exemption-for-tokenized-stocks-report</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/sec-postpones-plan-allowing-innovation-exemption-for-tokenized-stocks-report?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS13aHktcmVndWxhdGlvbi1pcy10aGUtYmVzdC10aGluZy1mb3ItY3J5cHRvLXNlYy5qcGc=.jpg\" alt=\"SEC postpones plan allowing 'innovation exemption' for tokenized stocks: Report\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>The SEC has reportedly delayed releasing a proposal permitting tokenized stock trading after receiving industry concerns.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Brayden Lindrea</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS13aHktcmVndWxhdGlvbi1pcy10aGUtYmVzdC10aGluZy1mb3ItY3J5cHRvLXNlYy5qcGc=.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS13aHktcmVndWxhdGlvbi1pcy10aGUtYmVzdC10aGluZy1mb3ItY3J5cHRvLXNlYy5qcGc=.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>Soaring bond prices signal 'structural' shift and Bitcoin 'supercycle': Analyst</title>\n      <pubDate>Sun, 24 May 2026 22:12:55 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Sun, 24 May 2026 22:12:55 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/soaring-bond-prices-structural-shift-bitcoin-supercycle</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/soaring-bond-prices-structural-shift-bitcoin-supercycle?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9zcG9uc29yLXNjcmVlbi10cmFpZDIzLmpwZw==.jpg\" alt=\"Soaring bond prices signal 'structural' shift and Bitcoin 'supercycle': Analyst\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>Fixed-income investors are in a \"panic\" as government securities, once seen as low-risk, begin to crack, according to BitMEX researcher Shang Wu.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Vince Quill</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9zcG9uc29yLXNjcmVlbi10cmFpZDIzLmpwZw==.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9zcG9uc29yLXNjcmVlbi10cmFpZDIzLmpwZw==.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>Buterin fires back at Ethereum Foundation critics, recommits to neutrality</title>\n      <pubDate>Sun, 24 May 2026 20:43:42 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Sun, 24 May 2026 20:43:42 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/buterin-fires-back-ef-critics-neutrality</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/buterin-fires-back-ef-critics-neutrality?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy92aXRhbGlrLXBvcnRyYWl0LTAwMi5qcGc=.jpg\" alt=\"Buterin fires back at Ethereum Foundation critics, recommits to neutrality\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>The Ethereum Foundation holds less than 1% of all ETH in circulation while other protocol foundations typically hold 10-50% of their native token's supply, the founder said.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Vince Quill</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy92aXRhbGlrLXBvcnRyYWl0LTAwMi5qcGc=.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy92aXRhbGlrLXBvcnRyYWl0LTAwMi5qcGc=.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title><![CDATA[FTX law firm Fenwick & West to pay $54M to victims in settlement]]></title>\n      <pubDate>Sun, 24 May 2026 18:05:52 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Sun, 24 May 2026 18:05:52 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/law-firm-fenwick-west-54m-ftx-settlement</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/law-firm-fenwick-west-54m-ftx-settlement?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS0xMGstcmVwb3J0LWZ0eC5qcGc=.jpg\" alt=\"FTX law firm Fenwick & West to pay $54M to victims in settlement\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>The law firm agreed to a settlement in February 2026 and is facing a separate $525 million lawsuit over its role in the collapse of the FTX crypto exchange.\n</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Vince Quill</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS0xMGstcmVwb3J0LWZ0eC5qcGc=.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS0xMGstcmVwb3J0LWZ0eC5qcGc=.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>Tom Lee’s Ethereum portfolio down $7.35B as ETH price outlook worsens</title>\n      <pubDate>Sun, 24 May 2026 15:08:08 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Sun, 24 May 2026 15:08:08 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/markets/tom-lees-ethereum-portfolio-sitting-on-73b-in-unrealized-losses</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/markets/tom-lees-ethereum-portfolio-sitting-on-73b-in-unrealized-losses?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1jcnlwdG8tcHJpY2VzLWFyZW50LXN1cmdpbmctYW55dGltZS1zb29uLWV0aGVyZXVtLmpwZw==.jpg\" alt=\"Tom Lee’s Ethereum portfolio down $7.35B as ETH price outlook worsens\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>ETH’s bearish chart setup points to a 25% drop toward $1,600, risking over $10 billion in paper losses for BitMine in the coming weeks.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Yashu Gola</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1jcnlwdG8tcHJpY2VzLWFyZW50LXN1cmdpbmctYW55dGltZS1zb29uLWV0aGVyZXVtLmpwZw==.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1jcnlwdG8tcHJpY2VzLWFyZW50LXN1cmdpbmctYW55dGltZS1zb29uLWV0aGVyZXVtLmpwZw==.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Markets</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>Here’s what happened in crypto today</title>\n      <pubDate>Sun, 24 May 2026 14:28:00 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Sun, 24 May 2026 14:28:00 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/what-happened-in-crypto-today</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/what-happened-in-crypto-today?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy0xMTA1ODktd2hhdC1oYXBwZW5lZC1pbi1jcnlwdG8tdG9kYXkuanBn.jpg\" alt=\"Here’s what happened in crypto today\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>Need to know what happened in crypto today? Here is the latest news on daily trends and events impacting Bitcoin price, blockchain, DeFi, NFTs, Web3 and crypto regulation.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Cointelegraph</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy0xMTA1ODktd2hhdC1oYXBwZW5lZC1pbi1jcnlwdG8tdG9kYXkuanBn.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy0xMTA1ODktd2hhdC1oYXBwZW5lZC1pbi1jcnlwdG8tdG9kYXkuanBn.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Trump memecoin</category>\n      <category>Solana memecoin</category>\n      <category>TRUMP token</category>\n      <category>Solana</category>\n      <category>SOL</category>\n      <category>Nova Labs</category>\n      <category>SEC</category>\n      <category>Securities and Exchange Commission</category>\n      <category>Crypto regulation</category>\n      <category>TRUMP rally</category>\n      <category>Bitcoin</category>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>CFTC officials who questioned prediction markets were suspended: NYT</title>\n      <pubDate>Sun, 24 May 2026 11:45:00 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Sun, 24 May 2026 11:45:00 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/cftc-officials-who-questioned-prediction-markets-were-suspended-nyt</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/cftc-officials-who-questioned-prediction-markets-were-suspended-nyt?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9sYXlvZmZzLWZpcmVkLWh1bWFuLXJlc291cmNlLWhyLWxlYXZpbmctcXVpdC1wZW9wbGUtMi5qcGc=.jpg\" alt=\"CFTC officials who questioned prediction markets were suspended: NYT\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>A New York Times investigation found that senior CFTC officials who raised concerns about Polymarket, Crypto.com and Gemini were suspended and pushed out.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Amin Haqshanas</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9sYXlvZmZzLWZpcmVkLWh1bWFuLXJlc291cmNlLWhyLWxlYXZpbmctcXVpdC1wZW9wbGUtMi5qcGc=.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9sYXlvZmZzLWZpcmVkLWh1bWFuLXJlc291cmNlLWhyLWxlYXZpbmctcXVpdC1wZW9wbGUtMi5qcGc=.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>Blockchain researcher defends Ethereum Foundation, says it’s doing ‘exactly’ its job</title>\n      <pubDate>Sun, 24 May 2026 09:35:00 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Sun, 24 May 2026 09:35:00 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/blockchain-researcher-defends-ethereum-foundation-says-its-exactly-doing-its-job</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/blockchain-researcher-defends-ethereum-foundation-says-its-exactly-doing-its-job?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS13aGF0LWlzLWV0aGVyZXVtLmpwZw==.jpg\" alt=\"Blockchain researcher defends Ethereum Foundation, says it’s doing ‘exactly’ its job\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>William Mougayar says critics are measuring the Ethereum Foundation by the wrong standard, claiming it was never meant to pump ETH or court institutions.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Amin Haqshanas</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS13aGF0LWlzLWV0aGVyZXVtLmpwZw==.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS13aGF0LWlzLWV0aGVyZXVtLmpwZw==.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>Why is Bitcoin falling despite pro-crypto Kevin Warsh becoming Fed chair?</title>\n      <pubDate>Sun, 24 May 2026 09:02:25 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Sun, 24 May 2026 09:02:25 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/markets/why-is-bitcoin-falling-despite-pro-crypto-kevin-warsh-becoming-fed-chair</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/markets/why-is-bitcoin-falling-despite-pro-crypto-kevin-warsh-becoming-fed-chair?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS13aGF0LWlzLWltcGVybWFuZW50LWxvc3MtYW5kLWhvdy10by1hdm9pZC1pdDItMS5qcGc=.jpg\" alt=\"Why is Bitcoin falling despite pro-crypto Kevin Warsh becoming Fed chair?\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>Rising short-term bond yields and Warsh's hawkish comments in the past are reviving fears of a December rate hike, which could slam the brakes on Bitcoin's recovery.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Yashu Gola</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS13aGF0LWlzLWltcGVybWFuZW50LWxvc3MtYW5kLWhvdy10by1hdm9pZC1pdDItMS5qcGc=.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS13aGF0LWlzLWltcGVybWFuZW50LWxvc3MtYW5kLWhvdy10by1hdm9pZC1pdDItMS5qcGc=.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Markets</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>StablR Euro and US dollar stablecoins depeg after $2.8M exploit</title>\n      <pubDate>Sun, 24 May 2026 05:45:00 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Sun, 24 May 2026 05:45:00 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/euro-and-usd-stablecoins-depeg-amid-ongoing-28m-stablr-exploit</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/euro-and-usd-stablecoins-depeg-amid-ongoing-28m-stablr-exploit?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1jb3JydXB0LWdvdmVybmFuY2Utd2hhdC1kby13ZS1rbm93LWFib3V0LXJlY2VudC1zY2FuZGFsLW5ldy0xLmpwZw==.jpg\" alt=\"StablR Euro and US dollar stablecoins depeg after $2.8M exploit\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>Stablecoin issuer StablR says it has been compromised, with Blockaid suspecting the cause is a private key compromise of an owner of a multisig wallet used for minting tokens.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Martin Young</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1jb3JydXB0LWdvdmVybmFuY2Utd2hhdC1kby13ZS1rbm93LWFib3V0LXJlY2VudC1zY2FuZGFsLW5ldy0xLmpwZw==.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1jb3JydXB0LWdvdmVybmFuY2Utd2hhdC1kby13ZS1rbm93LWFib3V0LXJlY2VudC1zY2FuZGFsLW5ldy0xLmpwZw==.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>Bitcoin bounces as Trump prepares to announce ‘negotiated’ Iran deal</title>\n      <pubDate>Sun, 24 May 2026 03:20:00 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Sun, 24 May 2026 03:20:00 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-bounces-as-trump-prepares-to-announce-negotiated-iran-deal</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-bounces-as-trump-prepares-to-announce-negotiated-iran-deal?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9nb29nbGUtbGFwdG9wLWJpdGNvaW4tdHJ1bXAtMS5qcGc=.jpg\" alt=\"Bitcoin bounces as Trump prepares to announce ‘negotiated’ Iran deal\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>US President Donald Trump posted on Truth Social that final details of a deal with Iran are currently being discussed, giving crypto markets a lift.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Martin Young</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9nb29nbGUtbGFwdG9wLWJpdGNvaW4tdHJ1bXAtMS5qcGc=.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9nb29nbGUtbGFwdG9wLWJpdGNvaW4tdHJ1bXAtMS5qcGc=.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>70% of all crypto wrench attacks happen in France: Report</title>\n      <pubDate>Sat, 23 May 2026 23:07:19 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Sat, 23 May 2026 23:07:19 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/70-crypto-wrench-attacks-happen-france</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/70-crypto-wrench-attacks-happen-france?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9jcm93ZC1hbmdyeS1vbi1jLW1hbi5qcGc=.jpg\" alt=\"70% of all crypto wrench attacks happen in France: Report\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>Centralized data collection is a honeypot for hackers and organized criminals looking to target crypto holders and their families, according to Bitcoiners. </p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Vince Quill</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9jcm93ZC1hbmdyeS1vbi1jLW1hbi5qcGc=.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9jcm93ZC1hbmdyeS1vbi1jLW1hbi5qcGc=.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>Analysts forecast a Bitcoin crash to the $60K level, revisiting 2026 low</title>\n      <pubDate>Sat, 23 May 2026 20:49:12 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Sat, 23 May 2026 20:49:12 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/analysts-forecast-bitcoin-crash-60k-february-low</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/analysts-forecast-bitcoin-crash-60k-february-low?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9taWNoYWVsLXZhbi1kZS1wb3BwZS5qcGc=.jpg\" alt=\"Analysts forecast a Bitcoin crash to the $60K level, revisiting 2026 low\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>The price of Bitcoin is about $75,800 at the time of publication, a nearly 40% decrease from the all-time high of about $126,000 reached in October 2025.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Vince Quill</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9taWNoYWVsLXZhbi1kZS1wb3BwZS5qcGc=.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9taWNoYWVsLXZhbi1kZS1wb3BwZS5qcGc=.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>Warsh will cut rates, despite consensus view of rate hikes: Analyst</title>\n      <pubDate>Sat, 23 May 2026 18:59:00 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Sat, 23 May 2026 18:59:00 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/warsh-cut-rate-despite-consensus-rate-hikes</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/warsh-cut-rate-despite-consensus-rate-hikes?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9iaXRjb2luLXByaWNlLW1hcmtldC1hbmFseXNpcy11czMuanBn.jpg\" alt=\"Warsh will cut rates, despite consensus view of rate hikes: Analyst\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>The current Federal Funds target rate is between 350 and 375 basis points, which traders project to rise by at least 25 basis points in December 2026.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Vince Quill</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9iaXRjb2luLXByaWNlLW1hcmtldC1hbmFseXNpcy11czMuanBn.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9iaXRjb2luLXByaWNlLW1hcmtldC1hbmFseXNpcy11czMuanBn.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>Binance denies new WSJ report alleging $850M in Iran-linked transactions</title>\n      <pubDate>Sat, 23 May 2026 14:03:36 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Sat, 23 May 2026 14:03:36 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/binance-denies-new-wsj-report-alleging-850m-in-iran-linked-transactions</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/binance-denies-new-wsj-report-alleging-850m-in-iran-linked-transactions?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1maXhpbmctdGhlLW5ld3MtYmxvY2tjaGFpbi1wb3dlcmVkLXNvbHV0aW9ucy1mb3ItbWVkaWEtaW4tY3Jpc2lzbmV3LmpwZw==.jpg\" alt=\"Binance denies new WSJ report alleging $850M in Iran-linked transactions\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>Binance CEO Richard Teng denied a new WSJ report alleging $850 million in Iran-linked transactions flowed through the exchange to the IRGC.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Amin Haqshanas</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1maXhpbmctdGhlLW5ld3MtYmxvY2tjaGFpbi1wb3dlcmVkLXNvbHV0aW9ucy1mb3ItbWVkaWEtaW4tY3Jpc2lzbmV3LmpwZw==.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1maXhpbmctdGhlLW5ld3MtYmxvY2tjaGFpbi1wb3dlcmVkLXNvbHV0aW9ucy1mb3ItbWVkaWEtaW4tY3Jpc2lzbmV3LmpwZw==.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>ECB pushes back on euro stablecoin proposals, citing financial stability risks</title>\n      <pubDate>Sat, 23 May 2026 10:56:00 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Sat, 23 May 2026 10:56:00 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/ecb-pushes-back-on-euro-stablecoin-proposals-citing-financial-stability-risks</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/ecb-pushes-back-on-euro-stablecoin-proposals-citing-financial-stability-risks?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1jaXJjbGUtd2FudHMtdG8tbGF1bmNoLWFtZXJpY2FzLWZpcnN0LWRpZ2l0YWwtY3VycmVuY3ktYmFuay1oZXJlcy13aGF0LWl0LWNvdWxkLW9mZmVyLmpwZw==.jpg\" alt=\"ECB pushes back on euro stablecoin proposals, citing financial stability risks\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>The ECB warned EU finance ministers that expanding euro stablecoin issuance could weaken bank lending and complicate monetary policy.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Amin Haqshanas</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1jaXJjbGUtd2FudHMtdG8tbGF1bmNoLWFtZXJpY2FzLWZpcnN0LWRpZ2l0YWwtY3VycmVuY3ktYmFuay1oZXJlcy13aGF0LWl0LWNvdWxkLW9mZmVyLmpwZw==.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1jaXJjbGUtd2FudHMtdG8tbGF1bmNoLWFtZXJpY2FzLWZpcnN0LWRpZ2l0YWwtY3VycmVuY3ktYmFuay1oZXJlcy13aGF0LWl0LWNvdWxkLW9mZmVyLmpwZw==.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>SEC approves Nasdaq to list Bitcoin index options on the exchange</title>\n      <pubDate>Sat, 23 May 2026 09:05:53 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Sat, 23 May 2026 09:05:53 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/sec-approves-nasdaq-to-list-bitcoin-index-options-on-the-exchange</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/sec-approves-nasdaq-to-list-bitcoin-index-options-on-the-exchange?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1iaXRjb2luLWdvZXMtZm9yLW5hc2RhcS5qcGc=.jpg\" alt=\"SEC approves Nasdaq to list Bitcoin index options on the exchange\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>The cash-settled, European-style contracts will trade under the ticker QBTC on Phlx, but still require CFTC approval before trading can begin.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Amin Haqshanas</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1iaXRjb2luLWdvZXMtZm9yLW5hc2RhcS5qcGc=.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1iaXRjb2luLWdvZXMtZm9yLW5hc2RhcS5qcGc=.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>$1.26B Bitcoin ETF outflows spark ‘contrarian’ buy signal: Santiment</title>\n      <pubDate>Sat, 23 May 2026 06:55:08 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Sat, 23 May 2026 06:55:08 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-etf-outflows-are-a-contrarian-buy-signal-santiment</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-etf-outflows-are-a-contrarian-buy-signal-santiment?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy0yMzcyOTItc3BvdC1iaXRjb2luLWV0Zi1vdXRmbG93LWludmVzdG9ycy1idGMtZHVtcC5qcGc=.jpg\" alt=\"$1.26B Bitcoin ETF outflows spark ‘contrarian’ buy signal: Santiment\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>Ongoing Bitcoin ETF outflows have historically “correlated with conditions favorable for patient accumulation rather than panic,\" according to Santiment.\n</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Ciaran Lyons</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy0yMzcyOTItc3BvdC1iaXRjb2luLWV0Zi1vdXRmbG93LWludmVzdG9ycy1idGMtZHVtcC5qcGc=.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy0yMzcyOTItc3BvdC1iaXRjb2luLWV0Zi1vdXRmbG93LWludmVzdG9ycy1idGMtZHVtcC5qcGc=.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>‘Not unlikely’ Strategy will sell Bitcoin in 2026: Michael Saylor</title>\n      <pubDate>Sat, 23 May 2026 04:24:09 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Sat, 23 May 2026 04:24:09 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/michael-saylor-strategy-mstr-bitcoin-sell-speculation-btc</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/michael-saylor-strategy-mstr-bitcoin-sell-speculation-btc?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1iaXRjb2luLXN1cHBseS1taWNoYWVsLXNheWxvci0xLmpwZw==.jpg\" alt=\"‘Not unlikely’ Strategy will sell Bitcoin in 2026: Michael Saylor\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>Strategy chairman Michael Saylor said the goal is to maximize Strategy’s Bitcoin per share by 2033.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Ciaran Lyons</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1iaXRjb2luLXN1cHBseS1taWNoYWVsLXNheWxvci0xLmpwZw==.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1iaXRjb2luLXN1cHBseS1taWNoYWVsLXNheWxvci0xLmpwZw==.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>Ethereum is still a good long-term buy, according data: Analyst</title>\n      <pubDate>Sat, 23 May 2026 00:29:18 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Sat, 23 May 2026 00:29:18 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/markets/ether-analyst-claims-eth-is-still-a-good-long-term-buy-heres-why</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/markets/ether-analyst-claims-eth-is-still-a-good-long-term-buy-heres-why?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS13aHktZG9lcy1ldGhlcmV1bS1oYXMtYW4taW50cmluc2ljLXZhbHVlLmpwZw==.jpg\" alt=\"Ethereum is still a good long-term buy, according data: Analyst\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>Ethereum’s dominance in DeFi, stablecoins and staking is strengthening the long-term ETH accumulation thesis, despite it’s 28% price decline in 2026.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Biraajmaan Tamuly</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS13aHktZG9lcy1ldGhlcmV1bS1oYXMtYW4taW50cmluc2ljLXZhbHVlLmpwZw==.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS13aHktZG9lcy1ldGhlcmV1bS1oYXMtYW4taW50cmluc2ljLXZhbHVlLmpwZw==.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Markets</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>Bitcoin 'Pizza Day' was 16 years ago, here's how much that BTC is worth today</title>\n      <pubDate>Fri, 22 May 2026 23:16:38 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Fri, 22 May 2026 23:16:38 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-pizza-day-those-10k-btc-worth-today</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-pizza-day-those-10k-btc-worth-today?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1mYW1vdXMtcGl6emEtZGF5LXdoZXJlLXlvdS1jb3VsZC1idXktcGl6emEtd2l0aC1idGMtaW4tMjAxOC5qcGc=.jpg\" alt=\"Bitcoin 'Pizza Day' was 16 years ago, here's how much that BTC is worth today\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>Laszlo Hanyecz's 2010 post, offering 10,000 BTC in exchange for two pizzas delivered to his home, marked the first recorded commercial BTC payment. </p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Vince Quill</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1mYW1vdXMtcGl6emEtZGF5LXdoZXJlLXlvdS1jb3VsZC1idXktcGl6emEtd2l0aC1idGMtaW4tMjAxOC5qcGc=.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1mYW1vdXMtcGl6emEtZGF5LXdoZXJlLXlvdS1jb3VsZC1idXktcGl6emEtd2l0aC1idGMtaW4tMjAxOC5qcGc=.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>Kevin Warsh sworn in as Fed chair, as traders forecast rate hikes in 2026</title>\n      <pubDate>Fri, 22 May 2026 22:12:01 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Fri, 22 May 2026 22:12:01 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/kevin-warsh-sworn-fed-chair-traders-rate-hikes-2026</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/kevin-warsh-sworn-fed-chair-traders-rate-hikes-2026?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9rZXZpbi13YXJzaC0yLTMuanBn.jpg\" alt=\"Kevin Warsh sworn in as Fed chair, as traders forecast rate hikes in 2026\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>US President Donald Trump has repeatedly said he wants the Federal Reserve to lower interest rates, but investors forecast no chance of a rate cut in 2026.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Vince Quill</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9rZXZpbi13YXJzaC0yLTMuanBn.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9rZXZpbi13YXJzaC0yLTMuanBn.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>Price predictions 5/22: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP, SOL, DOGE, HYPE, ADA, ZEC, BCH</title>\n      <pubDate>Fri, 22 May 2026 19:33:51 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Fri, 22 May 2026 19:33:51 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/markets/price-predictions-522-btc-eth-bnb-xrp-sol-doge-hype-ada-zec-bch</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/markets/price-predictions-522-btc-eth-bnb-xrp-sol-doge-hype-ada-zec-bch?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9hbmFseXNpcy1hbmFseXRpY3MtZ2VvbG9naXN0LW11c2V1bS0xLmpwZw==.jpg\" alt=\"Price predictions 5/22: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP, SOL, DOGE, HYPE, ADA, ZEC, BCH\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>Bitcoin sold off to $76,000, giving bears an opportunity to reclaim control of the crypto market. Meanwhile, altcoins like HYPE charted new highs.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Rakesh Upadhyay</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9hbmFseXNpcy1hbmFseXRpY3MtZ2VvbG9naXN0LW11c2V1bS0xLmpwZw==.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9hbmFseXNpcy1hbmFseXRpY3MtZ2VvbG9naXN0LW11c2V1bS0xLmpwZw==.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Markets</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>US House lawmakers launch probe into Kalshi, Polymarket insider trading</title>\n      <pubDate>Fri, 22 May 2026 17:20:49 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Fri, 22 May 2026 17:20:49 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/us-house-probe-kalshi-polymarket-insider-trading</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/us-house-probe-kalshi-polymarket-insider-trading?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1vdGMtb3Zlci10aGUtY291bnRlci10cmFkZS0xLmpwZw==.jpg\" alt=\"US House lawmakers launch probe into Kalshi, Polymarket insider trading\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>Representative James Comer asked CEOs of two major prediction market companies for information on their responses to insider trading after “suspiciously timed trades” related to US military actions against Iran.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Turner Wright</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1vdGMtb3Zlci10aGUtY291bnRlci10cmFkZS0xLmpwZw==.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1vdGMtb3Zlci10aGUtY291bnRlci10cmFkZS0xLmpwZw==.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>NEAR protocol leads AI token rally with a 50% pump: Is $5 NEAR price next?</title>\n      <pubDate>Fri, 22 May 2026 17:01:28 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Fri, 22 May 2026 17:01:28 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/markets/near-protocol-leads-ai-token-rally-with-a-50-pump-is-5-near-price-next</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/markets/near-protocol-leads-ai-token-rally-with-a-50-pump-is-5-near-price-next?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9uZWFyLWNvdmVyLW1heS0yMi5qcGc=.jpg\" alt=\"NEAR protocol leads AI token rally with a 50% pump: Is $5 NEAR price next?\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>NEAR price surges 50% in a week as AI token momentum, Nvidia optimism and network upgrades fuel bullish sentiment.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Nancy Lubale</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9uZWFyLWNvdmVyLW1heS0yMi5qcGc=.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9uZWFyLWNvdmVyLW1heS0yMi5qcGc=.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Markets</category>\n    </item>\n  </channel>\n</rss>","cwd":"/home/bhard/.openclaw/workspace-researcher"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1779708084875}}
{"type":"message","id":"88a64516","parentId":"6235adfd","timestamp":"2026-05-25T11:21:24.877Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_auto_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8' ?>\n<rss\n  version=\"2.0\"\n  xmlns:content=\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/\"\n  xmlns:wfw=\"http://wellformedweb.org/CommentAPI/\"\n  xmlns:dc=\"http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/\"\n  xmlns:atom=\"http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom\"\n  xmlns:sy=\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/syndication/\"\n  xmlns:slash=\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/slash/\"\n  xmlns:media=\"http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/\"\n  xmlns:snf=\"http://www.smartnews.be/snf\"\n>\n  <channel>\n    <title>Decrypt</title>\n    <description>What&amp;#039;s new in crypto and the advent of the decentralized web.</description>\n    <language>en</language>\n    \n    <atom:link\n      href=\"https://decrypt.co/feed\"\n      rel=\"self\"\n      type=\"application/rss+xml\"\n    />\n    \n    \n      \n        <link>https://decrypt.co/feed</link>\n      \n    \n    \n      <copyright>Decrypt Media</copyright>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n      <lastBuildDate>Sun, 24 May 2026 21:01:04 +0000</lastBuildDate>\n    \n    \n      <sy:updatePeriod>hourly</sy:updatePeriod>\n    \n    \n      <sy:updateFrequency>1</sy:updateFrequency>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Now You Can Buy Bitcoin, XRP and More in ChatGPT via MoonPay</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/368875/buy-bitcoin-xrp-chatgpt-moonpay</link>\n  <pubDate>Sun, 24 May 2026 21:01:04 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>MoonPay&#39;s new app lets users buy cryptocurrencies, including Bitcoin and Solana, through ChatGPT just by speaking with the chatbot.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Jason Nelson</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=368875</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/decrypt-style-moonpay-gID_7.png@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category>Artificial Intelligence</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/decrypt-style-moonpay-gID_7.png\" height=\"720\" width=\"1280\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Strategy Now Holds $65 Billion in Bitcoin—These Are Its Biggest BTC Buys</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/292448/microstrategy-biggest-bitcoin-buys</link>\n  <pubDate>Sun, 24 May 2026 18:53:09 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>How did Michael Saylor&#39;s firm amass a record stash of Bitcoin? Here&#39;s a look back at how Strategy made such massive gains.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Logan Hitchcock</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=292448</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/michael-saylor-bitcoin-lightning-x-twitter-gID_7.png@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category>Business</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/michael-saylor-bitcoin-lightning-x-twitter-gID_7.png\" height=\"2000\" width=\"3556\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>AI Startup Says It Will Pay People $2,000 a Month to Masturbate—Yes, Really</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/368866/ai-startup-pay-people-2000-month-masturbate</link>\n  <pubDate>Sun, 24 May 2026 16:37:04 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>Joi AI is hiring 10 “masturbation consultants” to test its AI-guided masturbation feature and report how it affects stress, sleep, mood, and confidence.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Jason Nelson</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=368866</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/ai-decrypt-style-08-gID_7.png@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category>Artificial Intelligence</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/ai-decrypt-style-08-gID_7.png\" height=\"1000\" width=\"1778\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Firefox&#39;s Big Redesign Gives You a Button to Kill All the AI</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/368867/firefox-redesign-kill-ai-button-project-nova</link>\n  <pubDate>Sat, 23 May 2026 17:01:31 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>Project Nova is coming later this year with a cleaner look, compact mode, and a toggle to make AI features disappear entirely.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Jose Antonio Lanz</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=368867</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/firefox-decrypt-style-scaled-gID_7.jpg@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category>Artificial Intelligence</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/firefox-decrypt-style-scaled-gID_7.jpg\" height=\"1440\" width=\"2560\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Bitcoin Dives Below $75K for First Time in a Month as Crypto Liquidations Near $1 Billion</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/368912/bitcoin-drops-75k-crypto-liquidations-near-1-billion</link>\n  <pubDate>Sat, 23 May 2026 16:22:30 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>Bitcoin touched its lowest price in a month overnight following an awful week for ETFs, which shed over $1.25 billion this week.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Andrew Hayward</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=368912</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/bitcoin-down-crash-decrypt-style-1-gID_7.jpg@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category>Markets</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/bitcoin-down-crash-decrypt-style-1-gID_7.jpg\" height=\"1080\" width=\"1920\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Argentina Launched an AI to Predict the Future. It Couldn&#39;t Predict a Typo</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/368860/argentina-ai-predict-future</link>\n  <pubDate>Sat, 23 May 2026 15:01:04 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>Milei&#39;s government unveiled a social digital twin to overhaul public policy—announced via a video full of AI slop, grammatical errors, and a deepfake of a minister.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Jose Antonio Lanz</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=368860</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/javier-milei-decrypt-style-01-gID_7.jpg@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category>Artificial Intelligence</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/javier-milei-decrypt-style-01-gID_7.jpg\" height=\"1000\" width=\"1778\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>3 Wacky Hermes Skills You Should Try</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/368188/3-wacky-hermes-skills-you-should-try</link>\n  <pubDate>Sat, 23 May 2026 13:01:04 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>A real astrology engine disguised as a fortune teller. A scammer-punishment machine loaded with the Shrek screenplay. A tool that reads any book and maps every idea to your actual life. These are not normal skills.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Jose Antonio Lanz</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=368188</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/ai-decrypt-style-07-gID_7.png@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category>Artificial Intelligence</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/ai-decrypt-style-07-gID_7.png\" height=\"720\" width=\"1280\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Kash Patel-Linked Apparel Store Goes Dark After Pushing Crypto-Stealing Malware</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/368856/kash-patel-apparel-store-goes-dark-crypto-malware</link>\n  <pubDate>Fri, 22 May 2026 21:13:00 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>User losses weren’t immediately clear.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>André Beganski</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=368856</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/fbi-decrypt-style-gID_7.jpg@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category>Technology</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/20